Z||000000||rogergarrison||09-07-2001||05:43 PM||||Lisa just called on her way back for school. in the middle of BF W Va. her rear brake hard line busted. Shes driving slower all on interstate to get it back. Shes been filling up resevoir when she gets gas. Guess Ill be checking mine out to be safe.||||reg||1
Z||000001||artherd||09-07-2001||06:35 PM||||Aack!  Hope she's allright!<P>The rigid line broke you say, wow!<P>I'm replacing all the lines on the Silver car, just to be safe. (I don't like the looks of the rears...)<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>Lisa just called on her way back for school. in the middle of BF W Va. her rear brake hard line busted. Shes driving slower all on interstate to get it back. Shes been filling up resevoir when she gets gas. Guess Ill be checking mine out to be safe.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
